<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Roles — System administration — MedSupply Portal</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>
  <main class="container main-content admin-main">
    <section class="admin-mgmt-panel" aria-labelledby="roles-overview-title">
      <h2 id="roles-overview-title" class="sr-only">Role definitions</h2>
      <%- include('../partials/admin-directory-tabs') %>

      <ul class="admin-role-def-list">
        <li class="admin-role-def-card">
          <h3 class="admin-role-def-title"><span class="role-pill role-pill-system">System administrator</span></h3>
          <p class="admin-role-def-body">
            Full access to this console: organizations, all users, documents, approvals, and audit. Use for your internal operations team only.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="admin-role-def-card">
          <h3 class="admin-role-def-title"><span class="role-pill role-pill-client-admin">Manager</span></h3>
          <p class="admin-role-def-body">
            Manages one organization: team members, uploads, and day-to-day document workflow within that organization. Created by a system admin after onboarding.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="admin-role-def-card">
          <h3 class="admin-role-def-title"><span class="role-pill role-pill-staff">Staff</span></h3>
          <p class="admin-role-def-body">
            Staff members belonging to an organization. They can upload and view documents according to your process; they do not manage other users or organization settings.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="admin-mgmt-footnote muted">
        To change who holds which role, use <a href="/admin/users">Users management</a> (activate or deactivate accounts) and <a href="/admin/companies">Organization management</a> (add managers per organization).
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
